Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi, guys. JOEY: Hey, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 大家好 - 菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, oh, how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是太好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He walked me to the subway and said, "We should do this again."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他送我到地铁站 并且说〝我们该再这么做〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ouch. - What? He said, "We should do it again."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？他说〝我们该再这么做〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是件好事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, no. Loosely translated, "We should do this again," means:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，简单地翻译 〝我们该再这么做〞是指
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"You will never see me naked."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝你再也看不到我的裸体〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从什么时候开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since always. It's, like, dating language.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一直都是这样，那是种约会语言
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, like, "It's not you," means, "It is you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝那与你无关〞 意思是〝全都是你的错〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"You're such a nice guy," means:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝你是个好人〞意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I'm gonna be dating leather-wearing alcoholics...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我要跟穿着皮衣的酒鬼约会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and complaining about them to you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他们抱怨你的事〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or, you know, um, "I think we should see other people," means:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我想我们该跟别人交往看看〞 意思是指
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Ha, ha, I already am."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝我已经那么做了〞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:47.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And everybody knows this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:47.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都知道这些事？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Cushions the blow.
