Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...uh, send our dog off to live on a farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把我们的狗送到农场去
