Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ha, ha. Hello. The Milner's farm in Connecticut?
