Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:01.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And there's 500 extra dollars in my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.28,0:05:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的账户多了五百块
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:09.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Satan's minions at work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.03,0:05:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}撒旦的手下又发威了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:12.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, because now I have to go down there and deal with them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:12.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我得去银行跟他们谈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What are you talking about? Keep it. - It's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你干嘛说呢？ 留下那笔钱 - 那不是我的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't earn it. If I kept it, it would be like stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是我赚来的 留下来那笔钱就等于我偷钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:22.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but if you spent it, it would be like shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:22.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，把它花掉，可以享受血拼乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's say I bought a really great pair of shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设我买了一双很棒的鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you know what I'd hear with every step I took?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道我每跨出一步 会听到什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Not mine. Not mine. Not mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.85,0:05:32.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝不是我的钱〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And even if I was happy, okay, and skipping...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使我开心地飞舞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:38.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'd hear, "Not mine. Not mine."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:38.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会听到〝不是我的钱〞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're with you. We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们同意你的说法，我们了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:45.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'd never be able to enjoy it. It'd be like this giant karmic debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:45.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我无法享受乐趣 那是一大道德考验
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, what are you doing? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:48.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:55.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超恶心的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What is this? - I'm smoking. I'm smoking. I'm smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这是怎么一回事？ - 我在抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you. You've been so good for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:01.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不相信，三年来你表现很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this is my reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.55,0:06:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on a second. Just think about what you went through the last time you quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.43,0:06:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，想想上次戒烟时你吃的苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so this time I won't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，所以这次我不戒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Put it out. - All right. I'm putting it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 把烟熄了 - 好吧，我熄了就是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:18.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't drink this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:18.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我没办法喝咖啡了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'm gonna go change. I've got a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我要去换衣服，我有约会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this Alan again? How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又是亚伦？情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:31.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's going pretty good, you know? It's nice and we're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:31.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常不错，你们知道吗？ 我们相处既愉快又开心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So when do we get to meet the guy? ROSS: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们何时能见到这家伙？ - 对
