Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.21,0:06:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我想一想，今天是星期一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Never. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 永远不可能 - 少来了
