Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不，在史提夫后是不可能了 - 你在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We love Steve. Steve was sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们爱史提夫，史提夫超性感
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:48.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
