Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我要让他们跟他见面？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bring a guy home and within five minutes they're all over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我带男人回家 五分钟内他们围着他问个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:09.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, they're like coyotes picking off the weak members of the herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:09.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们像是土狼，专挑弱小猎物下手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, as someone who's seen more than her share of bad beef...
