Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I know. I wish that once I'd bring a guy home they actually liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，我希望 我能带个他们喜欢的男人回家
