Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't do it. We loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:34.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我办不到，我们爱他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:37.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: We loved him. - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:37.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们爱他 - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're talking about someone that I'm going out with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们在谈我的约会对象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Yes. - And did you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对 - 你们注意到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:50.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Know what was great? The way his smile was kind of crooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:50.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道哪一点最棒吧？ 他的笑容有点坏坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, yes. Like the man in the shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，像鞋子里的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:54.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.70,0:09:54.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么鞋子？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From the nursery rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}童谣里的歌词
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:10:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"There was a crooked man who had a crooked smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:10:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝有个坏男人，带着坏坏的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who lived in a shoe for a while..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.25,0:10:02.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在鞋子里住了一阵子〞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I think Alan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想亚伦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:09.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...will become the yardstick...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:09.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}成为标杆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:12.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...against which all future boyfriends will be measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:12.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用来评估你未来所有的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What future boyfriends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么未来的男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. I think this could be, you know, "it."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.13,0:10:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我想就是他了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真的吗？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd marry him just for his David Hasselhoff impression alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会嫁给他，因为他的表情 跟大卫赫索霍夫一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:24.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know I'm gonna be doing that at parties, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:24.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们知道我在派对上会怎么做吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know what I like most about him? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们知道我最喜欢他哪一点吗？ - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The way he makes me feel about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他让我喜欢我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比赛还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:03.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We won! - We won! Thank you! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:03.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们赢了 - 我们赢了，谢谢，太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fantastic. I have one question: How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了，我有个问题 怎么可能呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Alan. - He was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 亚伦 - 他太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:13.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was like that Bugs Bunny cartoon where Bugs is playing all the positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:13.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他跟兔宝宝卡通里 每个位置都是兔宝宝一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But instead of Bugs, it was first base, Alan. Second base, Alan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但他不是兔宝宝 - 垒，亚伦、二垒，亚伦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, it was like he made us into a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他让我们成为真正的球队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yep. We sure showed those Hasidic jewelers...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我们真的 让那些东正教犹太人珠宝商
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a thing or two about softball. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.04,0:11:29.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 知道我们多会打垒球 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I ask you guys a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能问你们一个问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you ever think that Alan is maybe sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:35.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们会不会觉得亚伦有时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:39.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - I don't know. A little too Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:39.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 什么？ - 我不知道，有点太亚伦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:43.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no. That's not possible. You can never be too Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:43.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，那是不可能的 他不可能会太亚伦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:47.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's his innate Alan-ness that we adore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.27,0:11:47.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我们爱的是亚伦的内在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I, personally, could have a gallon of Alan. - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.31,0:11:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就蛮想有一加仑的亚伦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey, Lizzy. - Hey, Weird Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 莉兹 - 怪女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I brought you alphabet soup. - Did you pick out the vowels?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我帮你买了字母汤 - 你把母音挑出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but I left in the Y's. Because, you know, "Sometimes Y."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，但我留下Y 因为〝有时候非￥不可〞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:07.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, I also have something else for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:07.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还要给你一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Saltines?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盐脆薄饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but would you like $1000 and a football phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，你要一千块跟足球电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:13.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, my God. There's really money in here. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊，里面是真的钱 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Weird Girl, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怪女孩，你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I want you to have it. I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:23.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要你收下它，我不要这些钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. I have to give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得给你一样东西 不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:28.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's fine. You don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:28.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系的，你不必… 不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want my tinfoil hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要我的锡箔纸帽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, because you need that. No, it's okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，你需要它，没关系的，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please. Let me do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 让我帮你做些事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, all right. I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:40.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You buy me a soda and then we're even. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.19,0:12:40.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你请我喝杯汽水 我们就扯平了，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. PHOEBE: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:42.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好的 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用找了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, Lizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你，莉兹
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure you don't want a pretzel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的不想吃麻花饼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:52.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No, I'm fine. Thanks. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:52.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不，我不饿，谢谢 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:14:00.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A thumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一根拇指？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}GROUP: Ew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:03.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I know. I opened it up and there it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:06.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，我一打开就看到它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:09.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...just floating in there, like this tiny little hitchhiker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:09.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漂浮在汽水里 就像是有人要搭便车一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it's a contest, you know? Like "Collect all five."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:14.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许这是个比赛 你得收集五根手指
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does, um, anyone wanna see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人想看一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.50,0:14:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, hey, don't do that. Come on. - Cut that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 别那么做，少来了 - 别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's worse than the thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那比拇指更糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, this is so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:33.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why is it unfair? - So I have a flaw. Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:33.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 为什么不公平？ - 我有个缺点，没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:36.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Like Joey's constant knuckle-cracking isn't annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:36.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊老是按压手指不讨厌吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Ross, with his over-pronouncing every single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯说起来会咬文嚼字
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Monica, with that snort when she laughs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡笑的时候会发出怪声
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, what the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说那到底是怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I accept all those flaws. Why can't you accept me for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我接受那些缺点 为什么你们不接受这样的我？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does the knuckle-cracking bother everybody, or just him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}按压手指会困扰大家还是只有他？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:02.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I could live without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有它，我可以过得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:06.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:06.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:12.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, is it, like, a little annoying? Or is it like when Phoebe chews her hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:12.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它有点讨厌或跟菲比咬头发一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:18.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, don't listen to him, Pheebs, all right? I think it's endearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:18.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，别听他的，菲比，好吗？ 我觉得那很可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:20.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you do, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:20.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:29.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, there's nothing wrong with speaking correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:29.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发音标准不是件坏事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:32.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Indeed there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:32.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should really get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:36.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该回去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:40.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, otherwise someone might get what they actually ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:40.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不然有人会拿到他们点的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. The hair comes out and the gloves come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真相大白，有人说了实话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:04.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you ever go out with a guy your friends all really like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:04.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟你朋友喜欢的男人约过会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:06.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:06.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:12.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, I'm going out with a guy my friends all really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:12.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，我朋友真的喜欢 跟我约会的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We talking about the coyotes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:15.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是指那些土狼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Heh. All right. A cow got through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，有只牛逃过一劫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能相信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那像是…你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just don't feel the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一点感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, they feel the thing. I don't feel the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们感觉很棒，我一点感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, you should always...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:32.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜心，你应该一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...feel the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都有感觉的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:40.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, if that's how you feel about the guy, Monica, dump him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:40.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着，如果那是你对那家伙的感觉 摩妮卡，甩掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, it's just gonna be really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道，那真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he's a big boy. He'll get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，他是大人了，他会释怀的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:49.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he'll be fine. It's the other five I'm worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:49.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，他会没事的 我担心其他五个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have any respect for your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你尊重你的身体吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you realize what you're doing to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:53.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道你对自己做了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know, I've had it with you and your cancer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我受了你们跟癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and your emphysema and your heart disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:58.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肺气肿及心脏病
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The bottom line is, smoking is cool, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抽烟很酷，你们知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ahem. Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's Alan. He wants to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是亚伦，他要跟你说话
