Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, she told you about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她跟你说了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:22.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, yeah. I have one now and then. Well, yeah, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:22.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，我偶尔会抽，对，我正在抽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:25.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it's not that bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:25.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没那么糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:28.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gee, you know, no one's ever put it like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，没有人那么跟我说过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，他真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:52.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If only he were a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:52.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可惜他不是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
