Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:09.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我手里套着袜子三十年 它也会说话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I think it's time to change somebody's nicotine patch.
