Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:17.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:17.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:19.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where's Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:19.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey ate my last stick of gum, so I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.16,0:18:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊吃掉我最后一块口香糖 我杀了他
