Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得那是不对的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:31.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I think he's across the hall. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:31.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我想他在对面 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, I'm alive with pleasure now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我开心得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Pheebs, you gonna have the rest of that Pop Tart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比，你要吃剩下的果酱馅饼吗？
