Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:45.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要吃剩下的果酱馅饼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:48.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I might.
