Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.15,0:18:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.15,0:18:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, those stupid soda people gave me $7000 for the thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汽水公司的人 要为拇指的事赔我七千块
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:56.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, my God. - Seven thousand dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:56.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 天啊 - 七千块？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And on my way over here, I stepped in gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我到那里的路上踩到口香糖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is up with the universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个世界到底是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. I just think it's nice when we're all here together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:07.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事，我只是想跟大家一起聚聚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:10.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's even nicer when everyone gets to wear their underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:10.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果大家有时间穿内裤会更棒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:16.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Uh, Joey... - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:16.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Okay. - Oh, come on.
