Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:23.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, guys, we have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:23.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，各位，我们得谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:26.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait. I'm getting a déjà vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.47,0:19:26.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下，我有种似曾相识的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，我想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right, we have to talk. - There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.65,0:19:32.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吧，我们得谈一谈 - 这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's about Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，这跟亚伦有关
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's something you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该跟你们说一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:46.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, man, there's really no easy way to say this. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:46.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，要这么说并不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've decided to break up with Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.54,0:19:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我决定跟亚伦分手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there somebody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有了别人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, no. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，那只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know, things change. People change.
