Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We didn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:06.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没变
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So that's it? It's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就这样？一切结束了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:13.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:13.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就那样？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:16.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.94,0:20:16.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好不容易打开心房
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, you start to really care about someone, and I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的开始关心别人，我只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Look, I could go on pretending... - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 听着，我可以继续假装… - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, that wouldn't be fair to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.29,0:20:28.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，那对我不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it wouldn't be fair to Alan, or to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对亚伦或你们都不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, who wants fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，谁要公平呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I just want things back, you know, the way they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只希望一切回到从前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:43.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm sorry. - Oh, she's sorry. I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:43.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我很抱歉 - 她觉得抱歉，我好过多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:46.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:46.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:51.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, with the holidays coming up. I wanted him to meet my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:51.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快过节了，我要他跟我家人见面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll meet someone else. There'll be other Alans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会认识别人的，还会有别的亚伦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:56.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:56.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are you guys gonna be okay? - Hey, hey. We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们没事吧？ - 我们会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're just gonna need a little time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只需要一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:21.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm really sorry. - Yeah. I mean, I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:21.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我真的很抱歉 - 对，我是说我也有点抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I gotta tell you, I'm a little relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说我是松了一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:26.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Relieved? - Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:26.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 松了一口气？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I mean, I had a great time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你在一起，我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:30.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just can't stand your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:30.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我受不了你的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:41.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember when we went to Central Park and rented boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:41.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记得我们到中央公园租船的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.57,0:21:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:49.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. He could row like a Viking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:49.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对，他划起船来就像维京人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hi. GROUP: Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:56.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 嗨 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:04.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You know. - Did he mention us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.17,0:22:04.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你们知道的 - 他有提到我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He says he's really gonna miss you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说他会想念你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:19.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ROSS: You had a rough day, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.77,0:22:19.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的很不好过吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.19,0:22:22.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, you have no idea. ROSS: Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.19,0:22:22.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你才不会懂 - 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:28.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's it. I'm getting cigarettes. GROUP: No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:28.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 够了，我要抽烟 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:30.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:30.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Game's over. I'm weak. I've gotta smoke. I've gotta have the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:33.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}游戏结束，我得抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you never smoke again, I'll give you $7000.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要你不再抽烟，我给你七千块
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
